msgid "Licenses"
msgstr "Licence"

#: index
msgid "Swajp – Anax Keyboard"
msgstr "Swajp – tipkovnica Anax"

#: index
msgid "A keyboard<br><em>fit for an emperor.</em>"
msgstr "Tipkovnica,<br><em>vredna cesarja.</em>"

#: index
msgid "Swift as Anax – the emperor dragonfly.<br>Precise as its hunt."
msgstr ""
"Hitra kot Anax imperator – kačji pastir veliki spremljevalec.<br>Natančna kot njegov lov."

#: index
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Inspired by Swype. Born as Swajp.</strong> An Android keyboard you type on with a glide of your finger. It guesses words from context, learns your style, and all your data stays on your phone."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Navdihnil jo je Swype. Rodila se je kot Swajp.</strong> Tipkovnica za Android, na kateri pišeš s potegom prsta. Besede ugiba iz sobesedila, uči se tvojega sloga, vsi tvoji podatki pa ostanejo v telefonu."

#: index
msgid "Get it on Google Play"
msgstr "Prenesi z Google Play"

#: index languages
msgid "Language packs"
msgstr "Jezikovni paketi"

#: index
msgid "Features"
msgstr "Funkcije"

#: index
msgid "Swipe typing"
msgstr "Pisanje s potegom"

#: index
msgid "Glide over the letters and the word appears."
msgstr "Podrsaj čez črke in beseda se prikaže."

#: index
msgid "Word prediction"
msgstr "Predvidevanje besed"

#: index
msgid "Suggests the next word from what you type."
msgstr "Predlaga naslednjo besedo glede na to, kar pišeš."

#: index
msgid "Gestures & text editing"
msgstr "Kretnje in urejanje besedila"

#: index
msgid "Copy, paste, undo and select with one swipe."
msgstr "Kopiraj, prilepi, razveljavi in označi z enim potegom."

#: index
msgid "Themes &amp; colours"
msgstr "Teme in barve"

#: index
msgid "Six themes or colours of your own."
msgstr "Šest tem ali lastne barve."

#: index
msgid "Size &amp; layout"
msgstr "Velikost in postavitev"

#: index
msgid "Split, one-handed or floating."
msgstr "Razdeljena, za eno roko ali plavajoča."

#: index
msgid "Number pad & calculator"
msgstr "Številčnica in kalkulator"

#: index
msgid "Big digits, a calculator and a scientific one."
msgstr "Velike številke, kalkulator in še znanstveni."

#: index
msgid "Emoji"
msgstr "Emodžiji"

#: index
msgid "Type a word and the emoji flies in."
msgstr "Napiši besedo in emodži prileti."

#: index
msgid "Two languages at once, 35 in total."
msgstr "Dva jezika hkrati, skupaj 35."

#: index
msgid "Offline dictation"
msgstr "Narekovanje brez povezave"

#: index
msgid "Speech to text right on your phone."
msgstr "Govor v besedilo kar v telefonu."

#: index
msgid "Clipboard history"
msgstr "Zgodovina odložišča"

#: index
msgid "Your last 30 copied texts at hand."
msgstr "Zadnjih 30 kopiranih besedil pri roki."

#: index
msgid "Backup"
msgstr "Varnostna kopija"

#: index
msgid "Take your learned words to your new phone."
msgstr "Naučene besede preneseš v nov telefon."

#: index
msgid "No internet, no ads, no tracking."
msgstr "Brez interneta, brez oglasov, brez sledenja."

#: index (atribut / attribute)
msgid "Previous"
msgstr "Prejšnji"

#: index (atribut / attribute)
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Naslednji"

#: index
msgid "Another word from the bar"
msgstr "Druga beseda iz vrstice"

#: index
msgid "Capital letter"
msgstr "Velika začetnica"

#: index
msgid "Character from the key corner"
msgstr "Znak iz kota tipke"

#: index
msgid "Glide over the keys like a dragonfly."
msgstr "Drsi po tipkah kot kačji pastir."

#: index
msgid ""
"No need to tap letter by letter – one stroke across the letters of a word is enough. Swajp recognises the swipe even when it is not perfect, and learns your style so it keeps getting more accurate. Words with a similar swipe wait in the suggestion bar – one tap swaps them. For a capital letter, slide from the first letter up above the keyboard and straight on to the next one. A swipe from a letter to the space bar types the character from its corner, such as ? or !"
msgstr ""
"Ni ti treba tipkati črke za črko – dovolj je en poteg čez črke besede. Swajp prepozna poteg, tudi ko ni popoln, in se uči tvojega sloga, zato je vse natančnejši. Besede s podobnim potegom čakajo v vrstici predlogov – z enim dotikom jih zamenjaš. Za veliko začetnico s prve črke zapelji navzgor nad tipkovnico in od tam naravnost na naslednjo. Poteg s črke na preslednico napiše znak iz njenega kota, na primer ? ali !"

#: index
msgid "Next word suggestion"
msgstr "Predlog naslednje besede"

#: index
msgid "Fixing a typo"
msgstr "Popravek tipkarske napake"

#: index
msgid "Predicts your next word like a dragonfly predicts its prey."
msgstr "Predvidi tvojo naslednjo besedo, kot kačji pastir predvidi let plena."

#: index
msgid ""
"From the words before, it suggests what you are likely to type next – after a space, just tap it. It uses context to tell similar words apart and learns the words you actually use. When you tap out a word with a typo, the bar shows what you typed next to the fix, and the space bar inserts the highlighted fix."
msgstr ""
"Glede na prejšnje besede ponudi besedo, ki bo verjetno sledila – po presledku se je samo dotakni. Iz konteksta loči podobne besede in se uči besed, ki jih res uporabljaš. Ko pri tipkanju narediš napako, vrstica pokaže napisano poleg popravka, preslednica pa vstavi označeni popravek."

#: index
msgid "Copy and paste"
msgstr "Kopiraj in prilepi"

#: index
msgid "Undo and redo"
msgstr "Razveljavi in ponovi"

#: index
msgid "Select all and deselect"
msgstr "Izberi vse in prekliči izbor"

#: index
msgid "UPPER / lower case"
msgstr "VELIKE / male črke"

#: index
msgid "Deleting words and lines"
msgstr "Brisanje besed in vrstic"

#: index
msgid "Moving the cursor"
msgstr "Premik kazalke"

#: index
msgid "Text editing – the [I] key"
msgstr "Urejanje besedila – tipka [I]"

#: index
msgid "Selecting several lines"
msgstr "Označevanje več vrstic"

#: index
msgid "Start and end"
msgstr "Začetek in konec"

#: index
msgid "Rules the air. Now rules your text."
msgstr "Vlada zraku. Zdaj vlada tudi tvojemu besedilu."

#: index
msgid ""
"It flies backwards and forwards too – Enter → space undoes, Swajp → space redoes, up to 60 steps. Copy, paste, cut or select all with a swipe from the Swajp key to C, V, X or A, and change case with a single gesture. Slide left from ⌫ to delete whole words, or up for whole lines. Double-tap the space bar and slide to move the cursor as precisely as landing on a reed. The [I] key opens editing with arrows, selection, Start and End."
msgstr ""
"Leti tudi nazaj in spet naprej – Enter → preslednica razveljavi, Swajp → preslednica uveljavi znova, do 60 korakov. Kopiraj, prilepi, izreži ali označi vse s potegom s tipke Swajp na C, V, X ali A, velikost črk pa spremeniš z eno samo kretnjo. S potegom s ⌫ v levo brišeš cele besede, navzgor cele vrstice. Dvakrat se dotakni preslednice in povleci – kazalec premakneš natančno kot kačji pastir, ko pristane na bilki trsta. Tipka [I] odpre urejanje s puščicami, označevanjem, Začetkom in Koncem."

#: index
msgid ""
"All gestures with demos and practice are in the app: Settings → Gestures and guide."
msgstr ""
"Vse kretnje s prikazi in preizkusom najdeš v aplikaciji: Nastavitve → Kretnje in vodič."

#: index
msgid "Light green"
msgstr "Svetlo zelena"

#: index
msgid "Light"
msgstr "Svetla"

#: index
msgid "AMOLED black"
msgstr "AMOLED črna"

#: index
msgid "Blue"
msgstr "Modra"

#: index
msgid "Orange"
msgstr "Oranžna"

#: index
msgid "Purple"
msgstr "Vijolična"

#: index
msgid "Admire its many shimmering colours."
msgstr "Občuduj njene mnoge lesketajoče se barve."

#: index
msgid ""
"Pick a ready-made theme or set your own colours for the highlight, keys, special keys, background and text. You can also adjust the font size in the suggestion bar, vibration and key sounds."
msgstr ""
"Izberi pripravljeno temo ali nastavi lastne barve za poudarke, tipke, posebne tipke, ozadje in besedilo. Prilagodiš lahko tudi velikost pisave v vrstici predlogov, vibriranje in zvoke tipk."

#: index
msgid "Full"
msgstr "Cela"

#: index
msgid "Taller"
msgstr "Višja"

#: index
msgid "Smaller and lifted"
msgstr "Manjša in dvignjena"

#: index
msgid "Tablet"
msgstr "Tablica"

#: index
msgid "Floating"
msgstr "Plavajoča"

#: index
msgid "Spread your wings, or fold them out of the way."
msgstr "Razširi krila ali jih zloži, da ne bodo v napoto."

#: index
msgid ""
"Hold the Swajp key and pick Size: drag the handles to change the height, width and position. Make it taller, or smaller and lifted off the bottom edge, split it into two halves for both thumbs (Tablet), move it to the edge for one hand, or let it float freely above apps. In landscape the keyboard is lower and split."
msgstr ""
"Pridrži tipko Swajp in izberi Velikost: z vlečenjem ročic spremeniš višino, širino in položaj. Naredi jo višjo ali manjšo in dvignjeno od spodnjega roba, razdeli jo na dve polovici za oba palca (Tablica), premakni jo k robu za eno roko ali pa naj prosto plava nad aplikacijami. V ležečem položaju je tipkovnica nižja in razdeljena."

#: index
msgid "Number pad"
msgstr "Številčnica"

#: index
msgid "Calculator"
msgstr "Kalkulator"

#: index
msgid "Percent and brackets"
msgstr "Odstotki in oklepaji"

#: index
msgid "Scientific calculator"
msgstr "Znanstveni kalkulator"

#: index
msgid "Even sharp minds reach for a calculator."
msgstr "Tudi bistra glava rada seže po kalkulatorju."

#: index
msgid ""
"Hold the [I] key for the number pad: big digits for quick entry of phone numbers and amounts. The calculator counts right in the suggestion bar and inserts the result into the text. It handles percent (200 + 10 % = 220) and brackets, and the scientific mode adds functions, powers, degrees and radians – no switching apps."
msgstr ""
"Pridrži tipko [I] za številčnico: velike številke za hiter vnos telefonskih številk in zneskov. Kalkulator računa kar v vrstici predlogov in rezultat vstavi v besedilo. Obvlada odstotke (200 + 10 % = 220) in oklepaje, znanstveni način pa doda funkcije, potence, stopinje in radiane – brez preklapljanja med aplikacijami."

#: index
msgid "Emoji from a word"
msgstr "Emodži iz besede"

#: index
msgid "Catch your emotion mid-air."
msgstr "Ujemi čustvo v letu."

#: index
msgid ""
"Swipe or type a word – like “heart”, “beer” or “sad” – and Swajp offers the emoji in the suggestion bar. The :) shortcut works too, or simply pick one from the list."
msgstr ""
"S potegom ali tapkanjem napiši besedo – na primer „srce“, „pivo“ ali „žalosten“ – in Swajp ti v vrstici predlogov ponudi emodži. Deluje tudi okrajšava :), lahko pa ga preprosto izbereš s seznama."

#: index
msgid "Two languages at once"
msgstr "Dva jezika hkrati"

#: index
msgid "A new word for the dictionary"
msgstr "Nova beseda v slovar"

#: index
msgid "Hindi"
msgstr "Hindijščina"

#: index
msgid "Born to rule – in 35 languages."
msgstr "Rojena, da vlada – v 35 jezikih."

#: index
msgid ""
"Type in two languages without switching – the keyboard knows words from both. Tap an unknown word in the bar to add it to the dictionary of one language or both. In Hindi you type in Latin letters (Hinglish) and get Devanagari – or stay with Latin. 9 languages are built in (English in two variants), 26 more can be downloaded as packs."
msgstr ""
"Piši v dveh jezikih brez preklapljanja – tipkovnica pozna besede iz obeh. Z dotikom neznane besede v vrstici jo dodaš v slovar enega ali obeh jezikov. V hindijščini pišeš z latinico (Hinglish) in dobiš devanagari – ali ostaneš pri latinici. 9 jezikov je vgrajenih (angleščina v dveh različicah), dodatnih 26 preneseš kot pakete."

#: index
msgid ""
"<span style=\"color:var(--g)\">Green</span> languages are built in, the others can be <a href=\"languages.html\">downloaded as packs</a>."
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"color:var(--g)\">Zeleno</span> označeni jeziki so vgrajeni, ostale lahko <a href=\"languages.html\">preneseš kot pakete</a>."

#: index
msgid "Dictation"
msgstr "Narekovanje"

#: index
msgid "Hears you. Tells no one."
msgstr "Sliši te. Nikomur ne pove."

#: index
msgid ""
"Hold the Swajp key and pick the microphone – the text appears as you speak. Speech is turned into text right on your phone (Parakeet and Omnilingual models), with no internet. If you like, you can use Google recognition instead. Recognised words are checked against the dictionary."
msgstr ""
"Pridrži tipko Swajp in izberi mikrofon – besedilo se izpisuje, medtem ko govoriš. Govor se v besedilo pretvori kar v telefonu (modela Parakeet in Omnilingual), brez interneta. Če želiš, lahko namesto tega uporabiš prepoznavanje govora Google. Prepoznane besede se preverijo s slovarjem."

#: index
msgid "Remembers your copies. Forgets your secrets."
msgstr "Zapomni si, kar kopiraš. Skrivnosti pozabi."

#: index
msgid ""
"Hold Enter and pick the clipboard: your last 30 copied texts are always at hand – tap to paste, pin the ones you want to keep. Passwords, codes and text marked as sensitive are never stored, and the history clears itself after the time you choose."
msgstr ""
"Pridrži Enter in izberi odložišče: zadnjih 30 kopiranih besedil imaš vedno pri roki – z dotikom jih prilepiš, tista, ki jih želiš obdržati, pripneš. Gesla, kode in besedilo, označeno kot občutljivo, se nikoli ne shranijo, zgodovina pa se sama izbriše po času, ki ga izbereš."

#: index
msgid ""
"A dragonfly can cross the sea. Your learned words and typing style can cross to your new phone."
msgstr ""
"Kačji pastir lahko preleti morje. Tvoje naučene besede in slog pisanja lahko preletijo v nov telefon."

#: index
msgid ""
"Settings, your own words and everything Swajp has learned from your typing go into a single file – load it on your new phone and Swajp types like yours right away. The file stays with you: nothing goes over the internet or to the cloud."
msgstr ""
"Nastavitve, lastne besede in vse, kar se je Swajp naučil iz tvojega pisanja, shraniš v eno datoteko – naloži jo v novem telefonu in Swajp tam takoj piše kot tvoj. Datoteka ostane pri tebi: nič ne gre prek interneta ali v oblak."

#: index
msgid "You’re the hunter, never the prey."
msgstr "Ti si lovec, nikoli plen."

#: index
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Zero tracking, maximum privacy. </strong>Swajp has no internet permission. Nothing you type or dictate offline can leave your phone. No ads, no analytics. Nothing is learned or stored in password fields."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Nič sledenja, največ zasebnosti. </strong>Swajp nima dovoljenja za dostop do interneta. Nič, kar napišeš ali nareknaš brez povezave, ne more zapustiti telefona. Brez oglasov, brez analitike. V poljih za gesla se nič ne uči in nič ne shrani."

#: index
msgid "Privacy policy →"
msgstr "Pravilnik o zasebnosti →"

#: index
msgid ""
"<span class=\"o1\">They say when a dragonfly lands on you, change is coming into your life.</span>Let this one land on your fingertips."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"o1\">Pravijo, da ko nate sede kačji pastir, v tvoje življenje prihaja sprememba.</span>Naj ta sede na konice tvojih prstov."

#: languages
msgid "Swajp – language packs"
msgstr "Swajp – jezikovni paketi"

#: languages
msgid ""
"Languages that are not built into the app can be added as a pack. It is a plain zip with a dictionary – nothing gets installed and the app needs no internet for it."
msgstr ""
"Jezike, ki niso vgrajeni v aplikacijo, lahko dodaš kot paket. To je navaden zip s slovarjem – nič se ne namesti in aplikacija za to ne potrebuje interneta."

#: languages
msgid "How to add a pack"
msgstr "Kako dodati paket"

#: languages
msgid ""
"Download the zip of the language you want. It is saved to your Downloads folder."
msgstr "Prenesi zip želenega jezika. Shrani se v mapo Prenosi."

#: languages
msgid "Open <b>Swajp → Settings → Languages → More languages (packs)</b>."
msgstr "Odpri <b>Swajp → Nastavitve → Jeziki → Dodatni jeziki (paketi)</b>."

#: languages
msgid ""
"Tap <b>Import language packs (one or more)</b> and choose the downloaded file."
msgstr ""
"Tapni <b>Uvozi jezikovne pakete (enega ali več)</b> in izberi preneseno datoteko."

#: languages
msgid "Select the new language as your main or second language."
msgstr "Novi jezik izberi kot glavni ali drugi jezik."

