#: languages privacy licenses
msgid "Swajp – keyboard for Android"
msgstr "Swajp – tipkovnica za Android"

#: privacy
msgid "Swajp – Privacy Policy"
msgstr "Swajp – Pravilnik o zasebnosti"

#: privacy
msgid "Effective 21 November 2026"
msgstr "Velja od 21. novembra 2026"

#: privacy
msgid ""
"Swajp is an Android keyboard designed so that no data leaves your phone."
msgstr ""
"Swajp je tipkovnica za Android, zasnovana tako, da noben podatek ne zapusti tvojega telefona."

#: privacy
msgid "Internet access"
msgstr "Dostop do interneta"

#: privacy
msgid ""
"The app does not have the internet permission, so it cannot send anything you type or say. It contains no ads, analytics or trackers."
msgstr ""
"Aplikacija nima dovoljenja za internet, zato ne more poslati ničesar, kar napišeš ali izgovoriš. Ne vsebuje oglasov, analitike ali sledilnikov."

#: privacy
msgid "What is stored and where"
msgstr "Kaj se shranjuje in kje"

#: privacy
msgid ""
"<b>Learned words, word pairs and swipe traces</b> are stored only in the app's private storage on your phone to improve suggestions."
msgstr ""
"<b>Naučene besede, pari besed in sledi potegov</b> se shranjujejo samo v zasebni shrambi aplikacije v telefonu, da so predlogi boljši."

#: privacy
msgid ""
"<b>Clipboard history</b> (if enabled) stays on the phone and is deleted automatically after the chosen time. Text from password fields, text marked sensitive by the system and text that looks like a password or code is never stored."
msgstr ""
"<b>Zgodovina odložišča</b> (če je vklopljena) ostane v telefonu in se po izbranem času samodejno izbriše. Besedilo iz polj za gesla, besedilo, ki ga sistem označi kot občutljivo, in besedilo, ki je videti kot geslo ali koda, se nikoli ne shrani."

#: privacy
msgid "<b>Settings</b> stay on the phone."
msgstr "<b>Nastavitve</b> ostanejo v telefonu."

#: privacy
msgid ""
"Nothing is learned or stored in password fields or in apps that request incognito mode."
msgstr ""
"V poljih za gesla in v aplikacijah, ki zahtevajo anonimni način, se nič ne uči in nič ne shrani."

#: privacy
msgid "Microphone and voice input"
msgstr "Mikrofon in glasovni vnos"

#: privacy
msgid "The microphone is used only when you start voice input."
msgstr "Mikrofon se uporablja samo, ko sam zaženeš glasovni vnos."

#: privacy
msgid ""
"<b>Offline models</b> (Parakeet, Omnilingual) convert speech to text on the phone. Audio is not sent anywhere and is not kept."
msgstr ""
"<b>Modeli brez povezave</b> (Parakeet, Omnilingual) pretvarjajo govor v besedilo kar v telefonu. Posnetek se nikamor ne pošlje in se ne hrani."

#: privacy
msgid ""
"<b>Google recognition</b> (if you choose it) uses the Android system speech recognition service; Google processes the audio under its own policy: <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\">policies.google.com/privacy</a>. Swajp itself sends nothing."
msgstr ""
"<b>Googlovo prepoznavanje</b> (če ga izbereš) uporablja sistemsko storitev za prepoznavanje govora v Androidu; Google posnetek obdela po svojem pravilniku: <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\">policies.google.com/privacy</a>. Swajp sam ne pošilja ničesar."

#: privacy
msgid ""
"You download voice models yourself in your browser; the app does not need the internet for that."
msgstr ""
"Glasovne modele preneseš sam v brskalniku; aplikacija za to ne potrebuje interneta."

#: privacy
msgid "Export and import"
msgstr "Izvoz in uvoz"

#: privacy
msgid ""
"A backup is created only on your request, into a file you choose. It is never sent automatically."
msgstr ""
"Varnostna kopija se ustvari samo na tvojo zahtevo, v datoteko, ki jo izbereš. Nikoli se ne pošlje samodejno."

#: privacy
msgid "Sharing"
msgstr "Deljenje"

#: privacy
msgid "Swajp does not sell, share or transfer any data to third parties."
msgstr ""
"Swajp ne prodaja, ne deli in ne posreduje nobenih podatkov tretjim osebam."

#: privacy
msgid "Deleting data"
msgstr "Brisanje podatkov"

#: privacy
msgid ""
"Delete learned data in settings (Learning → “Smazat vše naučené”) or uninstall the app to remove everything."
msgstr ""
"Naučene podatke izbrišeš v nastavitvah (Besede in učenje → „Izbriši vse naučeno“) ali pa odstraniš aplikacijo, s čimer izbrišeš vse."

#: privacy
msgid "Children"
msgstr "Otroci"

#: privacy
msgid "The app collects no personal data, including from children."
msgstr "Aplikacija ne zbira nobenih osebnih podatkov, tudi ne od otrok."

#: privacy
msgid "Changes and contact"
msgstr "Spremembe in stik"

#: privacy
msgid ""
"Changes will be published on this page. Questions: <a href=\"mailto:swajp.keyboard@gmail.com\">swajp.keyboard@gmail.com</a>"
msgstr ""
"Spremembe bodo objavljene na tej strani. Vprašanja: <a href=\"mailto:swajp.keyboard@gmail.com\">swajp.keyboard@gmail.com</a>"

#: privacy
msgid "Developer: Aleš Brunner, Czech Republic"
msgstr "Razvijalec: Aleš Brunner, Češka"

#: licenses
msgid "Swajp – licenses and credits"
msgstr "Swajp – licence in zasluge"

#: licenses
msgid "Licenses and credits"
msgstr "Licence in zasluge"

#: licenses
msgid "Swajp uses the following data and libraries. Thanks to their authors."
msgstr ""
"Swajp uporablja naslednje podatke in knjižnice. Hvala njihovim avtorjem."

